WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.400
The machine life-forms called Zonderians.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.690
They were living beings who had built their own civilization...

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.820
...long ago in a far-off galaxy.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.910
But then one day, the culmination of all their machine technology...

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.040
...Zonder metal, was mistakenly developed.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:27.790
And this metal forced their evolution into immortal machine life-forms.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.020
Earth...

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:55.360
Creating Zonder metal of the purest grade on this planet was no easy task.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:12.130
The only true justice is absolute power.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.080
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:34.070
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:38.080
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:44.800
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.080
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:54.000
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.920
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:00.720
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.480
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:09.480
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.650
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.190
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:18.320
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.280
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:25.360
Dividing Driver!

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:33.000
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.880
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.830
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:45.720
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.560
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.560
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:53.150
Pursue the Black 300!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.980
<i>Pursue the Black 300!</i>

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.290
Huh? What's wrong?

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:16.920
What's that?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.070
It's a Zonder, right?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.700
This one's peculiar.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.160
It suddenly shows up in the middle of the night on the bullet train tracks...

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.500
...then vanishes just as suddenly.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.000
Why would it do that?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:56.960
All Zonders are swayed by their human hosts' emotions.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.380
I know!

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:02.590
I bet this Zonder used to be a bullet train freak who's crazy about trains.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.600
Well, that's pretty astute.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:09.100
So far we've had a Zonder who lost his family...

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.180
...a ferocious pro wrestler...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.940
...a young man who'd lost all hope in life...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.560
...and a stressed-out long-distance trucker...

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:19.030
...all chosen because of their mental instability.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.740
That Zonder from the other day was a...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.160
...former sea captain who resigned to take the blame for an accident.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:29.200
Since Mamoru purified him, he's been enjoying his retirement.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.500
Still, this new Zonder is going to be tough to handle.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.130
Since it spreads powerful electro- magnetic waves all over the place...

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.710
...any machine within its reach ends up getting trashed...

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.050
Needless to say, we can't detect it with the satellite system.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.260
Right.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.720
Unless we take action, we won't be able to stop it from...

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.390
...evolving into a robot like all the previous Zonders.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:54.560
HyoRyu and EnRyu's GS-Rides are in perfect working order.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.060
Please give us the order to deploy.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.480
Very well. Then tonight we will continue our surveillance...

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:07.620
I should've known you weren't sitting quietly in your seat for once!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.700
The Major is exhausted from his nightly patrol duty.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.080
But we are both tireless!

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.460
As long as we have a steady supply of fuel, we'll never even fall asleep.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.750
You make me proud, Mobile Unit!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:33.310
The Tokyo District Public Prosecutor's Office issued a warrant for the arrest...

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.430
...of vanished Diet member, Kinnosuke Otemori...

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.060
Well, good night, dear!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.270
Good night...

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.320
I sure feel guilty, dragging a 9-year- old out in the middle of the night.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.450
But I sensed a Zonder, so we had no choice.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.130
Major Hyuuma will be arriving soon.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.300
It'll be dangerous, so I want you to stay back, Mamoru.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.130
Okay!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.260
What?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.110
Mamoru! Look out!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:48.840
Big Brother Gai?

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.840
Mamoru, you're not hurt, are you?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:52.850
No.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.180
Big Brother Gai!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.850
What's the matter, Gai?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.690
What happened, Mamoru?

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.400
Did it show up? Was it the Zonder?

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.150
Take Big Brother Gai back to GGG!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:06.860
Hurry!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.660
Who knew those electromagnetic waves would be...

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.870
...too powerful for even Gai's special armor?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.880
It will take Gai 14 hours to make a full recovery.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.550
Really, if Mamoru hadn't been with him...

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.760
...Gai's G-Stone would never have been able to sustain his life-force.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.890
But that power of Mamoru's really is mysterious, isn't it?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.720
That boy is the key to solving the riddle of Galeon and the G-Stone...

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.770
...as well as those enemy Zonders...

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:45.690
The G-Stone, alien technology brought to Earth from outer space by Galeon...

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.830
Wait! Could it be that Mamoru is actually...

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.500
All right, vacation starts tomorrow, class.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.510
Try not to catch a cold or get hurt!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.510
And there will be no homework!

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.930
Goodbye, children!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.930
Hey, Hana, are you going anywhere?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.930
Me? I'm going to visit my grandparents in Yamagata.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.770
Oh, yeah? Lucky you!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.860
I don't have any plans at all.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.940
Ha! I'm going to Okinawa with my mother!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.860
Pooh, Okinawa! I'm off to the <i>real</i> tropics!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.530
Hawaii!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.530
Huh?

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.470
At the moment, nothing seems to be amiss.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.310
The Mobile Unit remains on standby.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.760
Mamoru?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.350
Yeah...

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.720
What's the matter?

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.680
Oh, um, I gotta pee!

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.520
Go right back to bed so you don't catch a cold.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:48.850
Okay!

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.780
Mom, I'm really sorry.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.030
Don't tell me... Mamoru?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.660
You're such a worrywart!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.790
I can't help it, I'm going to go check on him!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.370
Hey... it's all right. It's all right.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:11.340
That North Pole lion sank, they said so on the news, remember?

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.260
The Lion shaped object that sank into the ocean

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.050
I'm telling you, he won't be coming to take Mamoru back.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.050
But still...

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.810
That face I saw on that robot's chest...

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.770
It was that lion... I'm sure of it.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.520
Okay, fine.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.690
If you're that worried, then I'll go check on him.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.350
Mamoru!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.540
I heard that Mamoru sensed its presence.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.500
StealthGao, heading north.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.880
The Hokuriku Bullet Train Line?

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.420
That means it'll appear along the Yamagata Bullet Train Line.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.840
The electromagnetic waves emitted by this Zonder are quite powerful.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.380
I don't think it'll be possible for even GaoGaiGar to get near it.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.720
What's the solution, then, Professor?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.560
Although only temporary, the Mirror Coating can...

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.890
...provide protection from those electromagnetic waves.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.560
So we're just going to have to depend on HyoRyu and EnRyu, eh?

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.460
HyoRyu, EnRyu...

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.670
There are 219 steps outlined in our Standard Operating Procedure.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.090
I hope you've memorized them all.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.800
To the last letter, Major.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:22.420
Hey, don't underestimate the world's best A.I. System!

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:22.930
All right!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.350
It's beyond that mountain, okay?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:49.790
Waha!

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:51.620
Galeon!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.410
I wonder why...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:57.080
Just looking at Galeon really calms me down for some reason.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.540
He seems so familiar...

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.930
There it is! It's a black bullet train!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.600
It's a 300 Series...

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.650
Grandpa...

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.190
We can see the moon!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.490
HyoRyu, stand by!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.910
Commencing Mirror Coating!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.170
Launch!

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.960
EnRyu, Mirror Coating, launch!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.240
Let's go, EnRyu!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.780
I'm with you, HyoRyu!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.960
We shouldn't drop altitude any further.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.840
All that's left to do now is to count on HyoRyu and EnRyu...

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.880
...as long as their Mirror Coating holds up...

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:10.130
How long is it going to last?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.010
I'd say they have another two or three minutes.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.930
What? Are they going to be okay?

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.680
They'll be just fine.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.890
Because they're heroes!

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.620
Got it!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.000
The electromagnetic waves are attenuating!

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.660
The screen's back online.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.620
Nice going! Call it a success!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:46.000
All right! LinerGao, capture that Zonder!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.270
Good job, HyoRyu, EnRyu!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:30.960
What's that?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.360
Final Fusion, approved!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:49.690
Roger!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.110
Final Fusion...

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.740
...Program Drive!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.910
Final Fusion!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:46.160
GaoGaiGar!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.800
HyoRyu! EnRyu! System Change!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.180
Protect the neighboring area!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.970
System Change!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:19.740
HyoRyu!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:20.410
EnRyu!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.170
Chest Thriller!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.510
Everything's going to be all right now!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.430
Protect Shade!

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.980
If I get too close, those electro- magnetic waves will immobilize me!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.320
Major!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.440
I'm aware of that! And we're sticking to the plan!

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:59.360
Dividing Driver! Eraser Head!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.320
Launch!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.970
Symmetrical Docking!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:52.500
ChoRyuJin!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:09.180
Dividing Driver!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.530
Now's your chance! Smash those electromagnetic waves!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:20.570
Roger!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:24.450
Eraser Head!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:34.210
Hell and Heaven!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.880
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.570
You did it!

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.000
Mamoru, I need you to purify this.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.460
Right!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.510
Reporting for Yamagata Hometown TV...

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:34.020
This is aerial footage of the giant robot everyone's talking about...

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.940
This footage was shot just 30 minutes ago.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.150
Wait...

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.150
Hey, Ai!

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.980
Could that be...

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.150
Surely not...

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:49.370
Incredibly, it's the fugitive government official, Kinnosuke Otemori!

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.210
He's asleep... and he looks so sweet!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.210
I guess we were imagining things...

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:30.200
Later, the GGG Intelligence Unit discovered the host of this Zonder...

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:34.540
...Kinnosuke Otemori, had huge debts on failed land contracts involving...

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:41.080
...the bullet train lines. He was known to curse the trains themselves.

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:50.600
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:55.470
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:01.650
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:06.440
and you're searching for me.

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:10.610
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:17.540
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:24.300
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.300 --> 00:23:28.960
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:34.300
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:41.200
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.530
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:51.740
One day, the sun vanishes from the sky above Tokyo.

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:53.660
And GGG suddenly loses all contact with Gai...

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:56.200
...while he's confronting a mysterious, gigantic Zonder.

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:59.250
What is the Zonder's secret, glimpsed by GaoGaiGar...

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:02.920
...just as ChoRyuJin unleashes his Eraser Head attack?

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:05.920
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.590
"The Day the Sun Vanished"

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:10.670
The Day the Sun Vanished

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:11.380
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:15.680
Gai's Pendant

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:15.220
This is the Key to Victory!
